{
  "name": "LiveDub",
  "description": "Android app for live Persian dubbing of device audio using Gemini Live API (gemini-3.5-live-translate-preview). Captures internal audio via MediaProjection and AudioPlaybackCapture, translates to Persian in real-time, and plays back via AudioTrack with per-app volume control using hidden IPlayer.setVolume API on rooted MIUI.",
